cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Audel in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "Audel: Ears for AI Agents"
abstract: >-
  Audel is a machine-graded audio feedback loop that AI agents and media pipelines use to hear
  and listen to their own audio output, returning a pass/warn/fail verdict with time-grounded
  issues so the work can be fixed before it is called done.
type: software
